    "description": "This dataset presents results of dissolved inorganic nutrient concentration analyses made on water column samples collected in the open ocean Gulf of Mexico during cruises of the NOAA Ship Nancy Foster, May 10-30, 2017 (NF17), and May 5-19, 2018 (NF18). Dissolved inorganic nutrient concentration measurements include nitrate+nitrite (NO3-+NO2-), ammonium (NH4+), and soluble reactive phosphorus (PO43-).",
